# Revisions skipped by `git blame`: mechanical, tree-wide changes with no
# behavioural content.
#
# Enable locally with:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
# GitHub applies this file automatically.
#
# scripts/lint-changed.mjs also reads this file, and drops these commits when
# working out which files a change touched -- otherwise a tree-wide commit
# would pull the whole repo into the lint gate's changed-file set.
